.TH SDL_HINT_GDK_TEXTINPUT_DEFAULT_TEXT 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_GDK_TEXTINPUT_DEFAULT_TEXT \- This variable sets the default text of the TextInput window on GDK platforms.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_GDK_TEXTINPUT_DEFAULT_TEXT \(dqSDL_GDK_TEXTINPUT_DEFAULT_TEXT\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This hint is available only if
.BR SDL_GDK_TEXTINPUT
defined\[char46]
.PP
This hint should be set before calling
.BR SDL_StartTextInput ()

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

